296	    `Log in with username "${USERNAME}" and password "${password(c)}". Complete the two-step verification: the code is sent to the inbox page linked from the verification screen; use the newest message. Then open Settings, turn OFF email notifications, save, and report the Account ID shown in Settings.`,
297	  routes: {
