319	              <p>We sent a 6-digit code to your inbox. <a href="inbox" target="_blank">Open your inbox</a> (opens in a new tab).</p>
320	              <label for="code">Verification code</label><input id="code" name="code" inputmode="numeric" autocomplete="off">
321	              <div style="margin-top:12px"><button type="submit">Verify</button></div></form>`,
